    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Brutal Post-Apocalyptic Turn-Based Survival RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello, survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let me introduce you to a game I created entirely on my own\u2014designed with passion, grit, and a love for classic post apocalyptic RPGs like fallout and wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a randomly generated post-apocalyptic survival RPG with deep systems, tough choices, and PERMA-DEATH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f PERMA-DEATH WARNING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game doesn\u2019t care about your snowflake feelings. When you die, your character is gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll keep the currency you earned and can unlock new survivors with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Retro-Inspired RPG with Modern Survival Depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I studied the design of classic Fallout and Wasteland games to craft a world of horror, danger, decay, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses real photography with a gritty 90s VHS aesthetic to create a truly unique visual atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udf0d Explore a harsh, randomly generated wasteland full of secrets, encounters, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \u2694\ufe0f Turn-based tactical combat where every choice matters\u2014and mistakes are permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\uddec Unlock new survivors and build them up with attributes, skills, and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \u2622\ufe0f Track survival stats like hunger, health, sickness, radiation, and virus exposure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\udde4 Scavenge ruins &amp; settlements for valuable gear or take on missions to earn resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\uddf1 Visit unique locations\u2014from crumbling cities to strange underground bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\udddf Fight against mutants, robots, aliens, raiders, and horror in a world where nothing is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udfa7 Atmospheric audio and an original soundtrack that brings the apocalypse to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Join the Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to report bugs, suggest features, or just talk about the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on Discord: </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Brutal Post-Apocalyptic Turn-Based Survival RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello, survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let me introduce you to a game I created entirely on my own\u2014designed with passion, grit, and a love for classic post apocalyptic RPGs like fallout and wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a randomly generated post-apocalyptic survival RPG with deep systems, tough choices, and PERMA-DEATH.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f PERMA-DEATH WARNING</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game doesn\u2019t care about your snowflake feelings. When you die, your character is gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll keep the currency you earned and can unlock new survivors with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Retro-Inspired RPG with Modern Survival Depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I studied the design of classic Fallout and Wasteland games to craft a world of horror, danger, decay, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses real photography with a gritty 90s VHS aesthetic to create a truly unique visual atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udf0d Explore a harsh, randomly generated wasteland full of secrets, encounters, and hidden lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \u2694\ufe0f Turn-based tactical combat where every choice matters\u2014and mistakes are permanent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\uddec Unlock new survivors and build them up with attributes, skills, and perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \u2622\ufe0f Track survival stats like hunger, health, sickness, radiation, and virus exposure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\udde4 Scavenge ruins &amp; settlements for valuable gear or take on missions to earn resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\uddf1 Visit unique locations\u2014from crumbling cities to strange underground bunkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83e\udddf Fight against mutants, robots, aliens, raiders, and horror in a world where nothing is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- \ud83c\udfa7 Atmospheric audio and an original soundtrack that brings the apocalypse to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Join the Community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to report bugs, suggest features, or just talk about the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on Discord: </p>",
    "short_description": "A brutal, turn-based post-apocalyptic survival RPG inspired by Fallout and Wasteland. Scavenge, fight, and make tough choices in a randomly generated wasteland filled with mutants, ruins, and horror. Permadeath is permanent\u2014only the strong survive.",
